          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የማይመች ፡ ነበር ፡ እንደ ፡ ፎገራ ፡ ያለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወበእንተ፡ ዝ፡ አፍቀሩ፡ ብዙኃን፡ ከመ፡ይፃኡ፡እምህየ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህ ፡ ብዙዎች ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ከዚያ ፡ ወጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተው ፡ ሊሂዱ ፡ ወደዱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ለእመ ፡ ተክህሎሙ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይብጽሑ ፡ ለካልእ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መርሶ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢቻላቸው ፡ ወደ ፡ ሌላ ፡ ወደብ ፡ ይደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርሱ ፡ ዘንድ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘፊንቂ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይኸውም ፡ ፊንቂ ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘመንገለ ፡ አቅራጥስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በአቅራጥስ ፡ አጠገብ ፡ ያለች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘስማ ፡ ኤውንቄ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኤውንቄ ፡ የምትባል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘመንገለ ፡ የማን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቀኝ ፡ በኩል ፡ ያለች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፫ ፤ ⟪ወነፍኀ ፡ ነፋሰ ፡ ዐዜብ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከወደ ፡ ግራ ፡ ነፋስ ፡ ነፈሰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመሰሎሙ ፡ ዘይበጽሑ ፡ በከመ ፡ ፈቀዱ ፡ ወአል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐሉ ፡ ሥራዓ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ወደዱ ፡ ወደ ፡ ወደዱት ፡ ወደብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የደረሱ ፡ መስሏቸው ፡ ዐላማውን ፡ ከፍ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከፍ ፡ አደረጉ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሖሩ ፡ ደወለ ፡ አቅራጥስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ አቅራጥስ ፡ አውራጃ ፡ ሂዱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፬ ፤ ⟪ወእምድኅረ ፡ ኅዳጥ ፡ መዋዕል ፡ መጽአ ፡ ላዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሌሆሙ ፡ ነፋስ ፡ ጽኑዕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከጥቂት ፡ ሰዓት ፡ በኋላ ፡ ጽኑ ፡ ነፋስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነፈሰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ጥፉንቂስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥፉንቂስ ፡ የሚባል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘይብልዎ ፡ አውራቂስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባንድ ፡ ልሳን ፡ አውራቂስ ፡ የሚሉት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐተታ ፡ ቂልፂ ፡ ጉደሪ ፡ ጽባሒ ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማለት ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይእቲ ፡ ነፋስ ፡ እንተ ፡ ስማ ፡ ሰልቢባ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህችም ፡ ነፋስ ፡ ሰልቢባ ፡ ትባላለች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ ልክስክስ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፭ ፤ ⟪ወተለዐለት ፡ ሐመርነ ፡ ወተዘብጠት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መርከባችን ፡ ወደ ፡ ላይ ፡ ተነሥታ ፡ ወደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢክህሉ ፡ ኖትያት ፡ ቀዊመ ፡ ቅድመ ፡ ገጸ ፡ ነፋስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀዛፎቹም ፡ በነፋሱ ፡ ፊት ፡ ለፊት ፡ ቁሞ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መቅዘፍ ፡ አልተቻላቸውም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኀደግዋ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትሂድ ፡ ብለው ፡ ተዋት ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሖረት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሂደች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፲፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፮ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ነፍሐ ፡ ነፋስ ፡ እስከ ፡ ቦእነ፡ ደሴተ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንተ ፡ ስማ ፡ ቁዳ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚያ ፡ ጀምሮ ፡ ቁዳ፡ ከምትባል ፡ ደሴት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስትንገባ ፡ ድረስ ፡ ነፋስ ፡ ነፈሰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምዕፅብ ፡ ክህልነ ፡ ከመ ፡ ናርግዝ ፡ ሐመረነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጭንቅ ፡ መርከባችንን ፡ ከወደቡ ፡ ማሳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረፍ ፡ ተቻለን ፡ አርግዙ ፡ እንዲል ፡ ትግሬ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፲፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፯ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ተሐፂዘነ ፡ አጽናዕናሃ ፡ በአሕባል ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ዐላማ ፡ ትከል ፡ መልሕቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣል ፡ ብለን ፡ አጸናናት ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ሶበ ፡ ፈርሁ ፡ ከመ ፡ ኢይደቁ ፡ ውስተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጐተ ፡ ባሕር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ከጥልቅ ፡ ባሕር ፡ እንዳይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወድቁ ፡ በፈሩ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ቀዛፎች ፡ ናቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አውረዱ ፡ ሥራዓ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐላማውን ፡ ዝቅ ፡ አደረጉ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወረሰይነ ፡ ንሑር ፡ ከማሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
